{"id":"n57085-1-11","stage":4,"title":"문안 · 请安","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57085-1-11-1","ko":"설 연휴에는 뭐 해?","zh":"春节假期你打算做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"설","meaning":"春节","explanation":"설：春节。","readings":[{"term":"설","audio":"/audio/10ee4060ed35659d4b36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63209","senseId":"1","lemma":"설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설","audio":"/audio/10ee4060ed35659d4b36.mp3"}},{"text":"연휴에는","meaning":"连休","explanation":"연휴：连休；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연휴","audio":"/audio/381948faf6ba74167998.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67804","senseId":"1","lemma":"연휴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연휴에는","audio":"/audio/e95554afab3e7e099257.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"해?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"10ee4060ed35659d","term":"설","zh":"春节","audio":"/audio/10ee4060ed35659d4b36.mp3","entryId":"63209","definition":"韩国的传统节日之一，农历1月1日。这天早晨家人和亲戚们聚在一起举行祭祀，并给长辈们拜年。还要吃年糕汤，玩尤茨游戏、跳跳板、放风筝等民俗游戏。","pronunciation":["설ː"]},{"id":"381948faf6ba7416","term":"연휴","zh":"连休","audio":"/audio/381948faf6ba74167998.mp3","entryId":"67804","definition":"休息两天以上；或指那样的假日。","pronunciation":["연휴"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2fe70f72ec2fca7e6d38.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57085-1-11-2","ko":"가족들하고 친지들에게 새해 문안을 가기로 했어.","zh":"我决定去给家人和亲戚们拜年。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족들하고","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；하고：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들하고","audio":"/audio/8efd246007fd28f9bba5.mp3"}},{"text":"친지들에게","meaning":"亲朋好友，熟人","explanation":"친지：亲朋好友，熟人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"친지","audio":"/audio/ef060f37f39bc6bcadb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80601","senseId":"1","lemma":"친지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친지들에게","audio":"/audio/45956a230e4790352b3a.mp3"}},{"text":"새해","meaning":"新年","explanation":"새해：新年。","readings":[{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67897","senseId":"1","lemma":"새해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}},{"text":"문안을","meaning":"请安，问好","explanation":"문안：请安，问好；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문안","audio":"/audio/f404cb3042bbc09d7702.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57085","senseId":"1","lemma":"문안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문안을","audio":"/audio/85fa56bd2699e0df8e06.mp3"}},{"text":"가기로","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가기로","audio":"/audio/1a7fa13bb23284ecd122.mp3"}},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어","audio":"/audio/76f3569b074c48dd5200.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"ef060f37f39bc6bc","term":"친지","zh":"亲朋好友，熟人","audio":"/audio/ef060f37f39bc6bcadb2.mp3","entryId":"80601","definition":"互相关系密切而走得很近的人。","pronunciation":["친지"]},{"id":"9131dc433c64dfce","term":"새해","zh":"新年","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3","entryId":"67897","definition":"新开始的一年。","pronunciation":["새해"]},{"id":"f404cb3042bbc09d","term":"문안","zh":"请安，问好","audio":"/audio/f404cb3042bbc09d7702.mp3","entryId":"57085","definition":"向长辈打招呼问安的行为。","pronunciation":["무ː난"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f82e3aba02950d1eedf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.969,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57085","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我决定去给家人和亲戚们拜年。","怎么手脚这么凉啊？","春节假期你打算做什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我决定去给家人和亲戚们拜年。","春节假期你打算做什么？","怎么手脚这么凉啊？"],"answer":0}]}
